##  Kubernetes — Deployment with 2 Replicas

apiVersion:   apps/v1
kind:         Deployment 
metadata: 
  name:  inventory-deployment

spec:
 replicas:  2
 selector:  
   matchLabels: 
    app: inventory
  
 template:  
   metadata: 
     labels: 
       app: inventory 
   
   spec: 
    conntainers:  
    - name: Inventory-pod
      image: inventory:latest
      ports: 
       - containerPort: 80


